{} "Wrestling was conducted on three 5 x 5 metre mats in the " [:a {:href "/venues/233"} "Olympic Stadium"] ", exposing the wrestlers to the hot sun throughout the matches.  A small nearby enclosure was used as a reserve arena in the event of rain, and a few bouts did take place there.  The bouts were in 30-minute rounds, with three judges.  After each 30-minute round, the judges could declare a winner or order another round, with no limit to the number of rounds.  In the event that neither wrestler was aggressive enough, the judges could declare both wrestlers to have lost (today called disqualification due to passivity)."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Sweden’s neighbor, Finland, was the dominant nation in wrestling at Stockholm, winning three of the five classes, and seven medals, including at least one medal in every class."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/120365"} "Featherweight, Greco-Roman (≤60 kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "6 – 15 July 1912"] "\n" [:td {} "38"] "\n" [:td {} "13"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/120453"} "Lightweight, Greco-Roman (≤67½ kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "6 – 15 July 1912"] "\n" [:td {} "48"] "\n" [:td {} "13"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/120558"} "Middleweight A, Greco-Roman (≤75 kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "6 – 15 July 1912"] "\n" [:td {} "38"] "\n" [:td {} "14"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/120645"} "Middleweight B, Greco-Roman (≤82½ kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "7 – 15 July 1912"] "\n" [:td {} "29"] "\n" [:td {} "12"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/120715"} "Heavyweight, Greco-Roman (&gt;82½ kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "O